CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_ARCHIPELAGO_DESCR	The ultimate water map for Civilization IV. Powerful navies not optional!	
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_EARTH3_DESCR	Derivative map generator that simulates a randomized Earth.	
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_EREBUS_DESCR	Random map that creates a region of a fantasy type world where much of the world is unknown and irrelevant. It allows terrain to be created on a smaller, more detailed scale than planetary maps.	
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_FRACTURED_WORLD_DESCR	Evolving plate tectonics map. When the eons come and go, the world slowly changes as the continents drift and break apart, and new islands are created that may be driven into the continents.	
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_INLAND_SEA_DESCR	A large sea inhabits the center, surrounded by a thick ring of land.	
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_MEDIUM_AND_SMALL_DESCR	Realistic world with highly random landmasses medium and small. East and west hemispheres are divided by ocean, although rarely an island chain may connect them.	
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_PANGAEA_DESCR	Pan-Gaia: "One Earth," a massive single continent.	
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_PERFECT_WORLD_DESCR	Random map that simulates earth-like plate tectonics, geostrophic and monsoon winds and rainfall.	
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_RANDOM_DESCR	Map script which allows to randomly select a map script between Earth3, Erebus, Fractured World, Inland Sea, Medium and Small, PlanetFall, Sea Highlands and Tectonics.	
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_RING_WORLD_DESCR	Random map based on Larry Niven's famous 'Ringworld' novel. It creates a thin (16 tiles wide) but long map with artificial landmasses and climate.	
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_SEA_HIGHLANDS_DESCR	Highlands, valleys and mountain ranges with several bigger lakes.	
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_TECTONICS_DESCR	Produces mountain ranges, and simulates plate tectonics, giving more realistic/earthlike terrain (mountain ranges, mountains near coasts like the Andes, or between subcontinents like the Himalaia).	
CIV4GameText_MapScriptTools.xml	TXT_KEY_MAP_SCRIPT_TERRA_DESCR	Terra generates random land masses similar to those of the planet Earth. All players begin in the Old World. These maps are extra large!	
