Civ4GameText_Advanced_Diplomacy.xml	TXT_KEY_TRADE_WAR_REPARATIONS_STRING	Pay War Reparations	
Civ4GameText_Advanced_Diplomacy.xml	TXT_KEY_TRADE_WAR_REPARATIONS	Paying war reparations reimburses for losses caused by wars. War reparations are an expensive means to repair relations between former enemies.	
Civ4GameText_Advanced_Diplomacy.xml	TXT_KEY_MISC_WAR_REPARATIONS	War Reparations	
Civ4GameText_Advanced_Diplomacy.xml	TXT_KEY_TRADE_CEASE_RELATIONS	Will cause %s1_You to cease all diplomatic relations with %s2_Them for %d3 turns.	
Civ4GameText_Advanced_Diplomacy.xml	TXT_KEY_TRADE_CEASE_RELATIONS_WITH	Cease Relations With	
Civ4GameText_Advanced_Diplomacy.xml	TXT_KEY_TRADE_CEASE_RELATIONS_GLOBAL_MSG	[COLOR_YELLOW]At the request of %s1 the %s2 have ceased all diplomatic relations with %s3.[COLOR_REVERT]	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__ENABLED_TEXT	Enable Civ4lerts	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CIV4LERTS_HOVER	When checked, messages are displayed to alert you to various pending and existing conditions using Dr. Elmer Jiggle's Civ4lerts mod.	
