Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYPENDINGGROWTH_HOVER	When checked, displays an alert when a city's population will grow or shrink next turn.	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYGROWTH_TEXT	Growth	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYGROWTH_HOVER	When checked, displays an alert when a city's population has grown or shrunk.	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYPENDINGHAPPINESS_TEXT	Pending	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYPENDINGHAPPINESS_HOVER	When checked, displays an alert when a city will become happy or unhappy next turn.	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYHAPPINESS_TEXT	Happiness	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYHAPPINESS_HOVER	When checked, displays an alert when a city has become happy or unhappy.	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYPENDINGHEALTHINESS_TEXT	Pending	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYPENDINGHEALTHINESS_HOVER	When checked, displays an alert when a city will become healthy or unhealthy next turn.	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYHEALTHINESS_TEXT	Healthiness	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYHEALTHINESS_HOVER	When checked, displays an alert when a city has become healthy or unhealthy.	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYPENDINGOCCUPATION_TEXT	Pending	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYPENDINGOCCUPATION_HOVER	When checked, displays an alert when a city will be pacified next turn, ending occupation.	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYOCCUPATION_TEXT	Pacification	
