Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYCANHURRYPOP_TEXT	Can Hurry with Population	
Civ4lerts Options.xml	TXT_KEY_BUG_OPT_CIV4LERTS__CITYCANHURRYPOP_HOVER	When checked, displays an alert once a city can hurry the item it's building with the whip.	
